@word d'Sproochen = the languages
@word de Buschtaf = the letter
@word lëtzebuergesch Buschtawen = Luxembourgish letters
@word e grousse P = uppercase P
@word e klenge p = lowercase p

# === PART B: Verbs, More Nouns, Origins ===

# --- Main verbs ---
@word virstellen = to introduce
