@word schreiwen = to write
@word hoffen = to hope
@word léieren = to learn
@word duschen = to shower
@word richen = to smell
@word heeschen = to be called
@word sinn = to be

# --- Separable verbs ---
@word undoen = to put on
@word matgoen = to come along
@word mathuelen = to take along
@word ofsoen = to cancel
@word opfänken = to catch
@word zoumaachen = to close

# --- Spelling vocabulary ---
